{
  "title": "ISic001365. Funerary inscription for Primogenes",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\">&lt;Π&gt;ρι&lt;μ&gt;ο&lt;γ&gt;ένης</span></span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτη\n                    σεν\">ἐτελεύτη-<br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>σεν</span>  <span data-text=\"ζήσας\">ζήσας</span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\">ἔτη</span>  <span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">ο</span>´ <span data-text=\"καὶ\">καὶ</span>  <span data-text=\"ἐν\n                    θάδε\">ἐν-<br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>θάδε</span>  <span data-text=\"κῖται\">κῖται</span>  <br id=\"al6-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>(Χριστό)ς </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\">l.1 Π | μ | γ</p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ΓιΠριιγμομγένης\">ΓΙΡΙΙΓΟΜΕΝΗΣ</span></span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-text=\"ἐτελεύτη\n                    σεν\">ΕΤΕΛΕΥΤΗ<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>ΣΕΝ</span><span data-text=\"ζήσας\">ΖΗΣΑΣ</span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-text=\"ἔτη\">ΕΤΗ</span><span class=\"supraline\" title=\"line above\">Ο</span><span data-text=\"καὶ\">ΚΑΙ</span><span data-text=\"ἐν\n                    θάδε\">ΕΝ<br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>ΘΑΔΕ</span><span data-text=\"κῖται\">ΚΙΤΑΙ</span><br id=\"al6-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">6</span>☧Σ</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\">l.1 Π | μ | γ</p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text after Le Blant and IG</span></span>; </li><li><span class=\"line 1\">line.1: <span>l. 1 ριοένη IG XIV 546; ριομένη CIG IV 9490; ΓΙΡΙΓΟΜΕΝΗΣ Amico, Ferrara, Le Blant</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo</a></p>  <p>Primogenes died at the age of 50 and lies here.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The inscription is Christian, as indicated by the Christogram in l. 6. For the name <span class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Πριμογένης</span> (with μ and γ transposed) in Sicily, see IGCVO 1339 (Syracuse, a Christian inscription).</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Amico 1741 267 no. X <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186</a>  </li><li> Ferrara 1829 368 no. 3 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002005\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002005</a>  </li><li> Le Blant 1856 xxxviii n.4 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001398\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001398</a></li><li> Kirchhoff 1877 9490 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249</a></li><li> Kaibel 1890 <a href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">546</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072</a></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>lunate sigma and epsilon</p> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence </div>",
